        "value": {
          "assignee": "ALL_PARTIES",
          "readOnly": "Yes",
          "directionText": "Make an application to the court if you believe any party or witness needs help with:\n\n- understanding proceedings and their role in them in court\n- putting their views to the court\n- instructing their representatives before, during and after the hearing\n- attending the hearing without significant distress\n\nIf possible, include in your application:\n\n- why the party or witness would benefit from help\n- the kind of help that would benefit them the most in giving evidence or participating, and is practically possible\n- written confirmation from any relevant witnesses of their view\n",
          "directionType": "Request help to take part in proceedings",
          "directionNeeded": "Yes",
          "directionRemovable": "Yes"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "bdde7972-0bbf-4227-a073-a20da60e0518",
        "value": {
          "assignee": "ALL_PARTIES",
          "readOnly": "Yes",
          "directionText": "Serve requests for disclosure on any third parties, for example the police or a hospital.\n\nIf you plan to ask for a disclosure order at the case management hearing, let the third party know in writing. Include a copy of this order.\n\nAnything disclosed in this case is confidential. It cannot be shown to any third party without the court's permission.  \n",
          "directionType": "Ask for disclosure",
          "directionNeeded": "Yes",
          "directionRemovable": "Yes"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "d5580a56-4af1-4f60-8744-0802804860a7",
        "value": {
          "assignee": "ALL_PARTIES",
          "readOnly": "No",
